  "worked_solution": "From the table, notice that\n\n$$\nP(Z\\le 2.3263)=0.99.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(Z\\ge 2.3263)=1-0.99=0.01.\n$$\n\nBy the symmetry of the standard normal distribution, we have\n\n$$\nΦ(-2.3263)=0.01.\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14111253/assets/2212ee9de7a440c5d61814d1b2b50a249849756a4aa331e4f48180c67f95944f.png)\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Φ(-2.3263) & =0.01 \\\\ P(Z\\le -2.3263) & =0.01.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required value of $z$ is $-2.3263.$",
